cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GOVP in research or an implementation, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "GOVP: an open protocol for portable, independently verifiable artifacts"
type: software
authors:
  - name: Gemacode
version: 0.1.9
date-released: 2026-08-05
repository-code: "https://github.com/govp-protocol/govp"
url: "https://govp.io"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  GOVP binds a readable Ed25519-signed record to an artifact identifier and
  the SHA-256 digest of exact artifact bytes. Verification is deterministic
  and does not require a GOVP account, central API or hosted service.
keywords:
  - artifact verification
  - digital signatures
  - Ed25519
  - provenance
  - conformance
  - open protocol
